{"id": null, "n": "0486016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0486016", "type": "orig", "text": "〔名也〕－【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0486017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0486017", "type": "orig", "text": "（（於蘊…空））十字＝（（則不厭於蘊若有彼無見））十字【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0487001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0487001", "type": "orig", "text": "具＝故【宋】【元】【宮】"}
