{"id": null, "n": "0487003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0487003", "type": "orig", "text": "業苦＝苦業【宋】【元】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0487004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0487004", "type": "orig", "text": "（（一切…法））十五字＝（（因果生諸世無別有眾生唯是於空法還自生空法））二十字【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0487005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0487005", "type": "orig", "text": "時＝轉【明】"}
